     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div>If I test candidate of 15 models and get there AICc values when i try to test only 3 modles out of the 15 i get diffrent AICc values for the 3 models.</div><div>The AICc value doesn&#39;t  suppose to remain the same ?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks </div></div>"
    ]
