    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Ron<div><br></div><div>Information Criteria (ICs), like the AIC change for each model, the lower value indicates better fit. </div><div><br></div><div>ICs are commonly use to compare non-nested models, the big disadvantage is that there is no clear guidelines of how big of a differences its relevant and no p-value to test the null hypothesis of equal fit between models. </div><div><br></div><div>Another option, you can use the nonnest2 package, that uses the Voung method to compare non-nested models, it works with lavaan objects</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span>Preacher, K. J., &amp; Merkle, E. C. (2012). The problem of model selection uncertainty in structural equation modeling. </span><i>Psychological Methods</i><span>, </span><i>17</i><span>(1), 1–14. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1037/a0026804\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://doi.org/10.1037/a0026804&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792426261597000&amp;usg=AOvVaw33wNKZQ5Z22L2AonNlKCW-\">https://doi.org/10.1037/a0026804</a></span><br></div><div><div style=\"line-height:2;margin-left:2em\">\r\n  <div>Merkle, E. C., You, D., &amp; Preacher, K. J. (2016). Testing nonnested structural equation models. <i>Psychological Methods</i>, <i>21</i>(2), 151–163. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1037/met0000038\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://doi.org/10.1037/met0000038&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792426261597000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0u7xKOZPhx0dsUbCmQsdki\">https://doi.org/10.1037/met0000038</a></div>\r\n  <span title=\"url_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fzotero.org%3A2&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1037%2Fmet0000038&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Testing%20nonnested%20structural%20equation%20models.&amp;rft.jtitle=Psychological%20Methods&amp;rft.volume=21&amp;rft.issue=2&amp;rft.aufirst=Edgar%20C.&amp;rft.aulast=Merkle&amp;rft.au=Edgar%20C.%20Merkle&amp;rft.au=Dongjun%20You&amp;rft.au=Kristopher%20J.%20Preacher&amp;rft.date=2016&amp;rft.pages=151-163&amp;rft.spage=151&amp;rft.epage=163&amp;rft.issn=1939-1463%2C%201082-989X&amp;rft.language=en\"></span></div></div></div>"
